{"id":"07ed6aa02ba5b923c29af9f1a4061854","uri":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/dan-carlins-hardcore-history/id173001861","status":"ok","type":"PodcastSeries","type_path":["Thing","CreativeWork","Intangible","Series","CreativeWorkSeries","PodcastSeries"],"name":"Dan Carlin's Hardcore History","description":"In \"Hardcore History\" journalist and broadcaster Dan Carlin takes his \"Martian\", unorthodox way of thinking and applies it to the past. Was Alexander the Great as bad a person as Adolf Hitler? What would Apaches with modern weapons be like? Will our modern civilization ever fall like civilizations from past eras? This isn't academic history (and Carlin isn't a historian) but the podcast's unique blend of high drama, masterful narration and Twilight Zone-style twists has entertained millions of listeners.","image":"https://is1-ssl.mzstatic.com/image/thumb/Podcasts115/v4/49/b7/eb/49b7eb32-8f08-6fac-aadb-2f002131fe5f/mza_15196161972010256532.jpg/1200x1200bf.webp","site":"Apple Podcasts","point":null,"start":null,"end":null,"group":{"id":"eaec3d707d36403f98a387fc68d24daa","size":4},"also_on":[{"id":"0180a667d9b1e0f44ba97d0b99f48fdc","uri":"https://open.spotify.com/show/72qiPaoDRf8HkGKEChvG5q","site":"Spotify"},{"id":"1a643d760123cd2252ca290afea45130","uri":"https://feeds.feedburner.com/dancarlin/history?format=xml","site":"feeds.feedburner.com"},{"id":"c7d3009596d2a82163af4c4e884420f1","uri":"https://podcastindex.org/podcast/767934","site":"Podcast Index"},{"uri":"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/id173001861","site":"Apple Podcasts","derived":true,"via":"itunes"},{"uri":"https://castro.fm/itunes/173001861","site":"Castro","derived":true,"via":"itunes"},{"uri":"https://overcast.fm/itunes173001861","site":"Overcast","derived":true,"via":"itunes"},{"uri":"https://pca.st/itunes/173001861","site":"Pocket Casts","derived":true,"via":"itunes"}],"refs":["https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/dan-carlins-hardcore-history/id173001861"],"collections":0,"open_in":